  "name": "Three-Bean Vegetarian Chili",
  "subtitle": "A hearty, three-bean chili with peppers and warm spices.",
  "description": "A generously seasoned vegetable chili simmered with tomatoes, black beans, kidney beans, and chickpeas, finished with optional creamy and fresh toppings.",
